WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.251
Doing that with you,

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:05.547
I've actually never done that with
another actor, but I've never played

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:08.133
the same role.
The same person.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.722
How have you felt so far
working with me?

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.889
Mostly behind the scenes.

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.350
Yeah, I mean the most fun thing
to do was on my days off

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.561
is when I'd have the opportunity
to come watch you guys.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:22.981
We still have not worked
together, technically.

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:26.401
Not really.
No one wants to see

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.695
the Kurt Russell and Wyatt Russell combos.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.321
Thank God for Godzilla!

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:33.283
We both get to work with Godzilla.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.451
He fails to hit his marks,

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.036
never knows his lines,

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.996
but the sh*t he can do with his mouth?

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:38.747
He's incredible.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.917
Being in the business
for as long as you have,

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.754
still being the most 
excited person on set,

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:46.713
Hoo-ah!

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.465
It's fun for me to see my dad

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.008
be that person for other people.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.468
Hell of a job, co-pilot.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:53.636
How many fathers and sons
have that opportunity?

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.345
Yeah, you got that right.

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:55.597
I'm just really glad we did it.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:57.057
It was fun. It was great.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.100
I had a ball with you.
Yeah me too.

